---
title: "RawTherapee 5.6 Release Candidate 2"
date: 2019-04-17T14:56:00+00:00
author: DrSlony
---


<div id="article_show_text">We have just tagged RawTherapee 5.6 Release Candidate 2 (this is not the final 5.6 release yet). Builds for testing available <a href="https://discuss.pixls.us/t/test-rawtherapee-5-6-rc2/12165">in the forum</a>. To get the source code, either clone from git and checkout tag <code>5.6-rc2</code>, or get our <a href="https://rawtherapee.com/shared/source/">tarball</a> (do not use the auto-generated GitHub release tarballs). Only important bug fixes and translation updates are permitted between this release candidate and the final release. Test it and report issues in <a href="https://github.com/Beep6581/RawTherapee/issues/new">GitHub</a> or in the <a href="https://discuss.pixls.us/c/software/rawtherapee">forum</a>. If all goes well then we will release RawTherapee 5.6 within a week.</div>

